fficulty. Beware not getting them done by 6 AM...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIX APPLIANCES OR ELSE!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294600/extras/675e39eab825470e2bf89502b461bd01.poster.avif?t=1723045894\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294600/extras/675e39eab825470e2bf89502b461bd01.webm?t=1723045894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294600/extras/675e39eab825470e2bf89502b461bd01.mp4?t=1723045894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Chores aren't the only thing you have to worry about! A broken breaker can suddenly and randomly go off. Is it hot in here? You best believe you aren't the only entity bothered by the broken furnace.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU COLLECT THEM ALL?</h2>Competitively earn achievements for surviving every night and finding and playing the tapes. It won't be easy!",
